  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Finanzauto S.A. BIC A/B Loan for productive financing to MSMEs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project consists of providing support to Finanzauto S.A. BIC through a syndicated senior loan for a total amount of up to US$60 million, comprised of: (i) a senior A loan for an amount in COP for the equivalent of up to US$25 million financed by IDB Invest; and (ii) a senior B loan for an amount of up to US$35 million to be financed through the sale of shares to private banks. The loan will have a term of up to five years. The loan proceeds will be used to support the growth of the loan portfolio in: (i) micro, small and medium-sized enterprises in various economic sectors that acquire a vehicle as a productive asset to develop their economic activity; and (ii) the credit portfolio to finance electric and plug-in hybrid vehicles.</narrative>
  </description>
